+endpoint types are unchanged. No supplied code, compiler, generator or Rocq
+production was executed as part of the record review or documentation work; no
+internal PA endpoint or minimum-state theorem is asserted.
+
+**Saved evidence package:** publication of the runtime evidence packet is pending.
+Its saved-reader checks and publication will be recorded here separately from the
+accepted actual results and exact source adoption above.
